semgrep==1.182.1
# NOTE: semgrep-requirements.txt hand-pins pyjwt==2.15.0 (security fixes), outside semgrep's own
# `pyjwt~=2.13.0` range. Regenerating with pip-compile reverts it to 2.13.0 until semgrep relaxes
# that range - see the --no-deps note in semgrep.yml before regenerating.
# The .txt also hand-pins mcp==1.30.0 (fixes GHSA-84m7-p3x7-pcfv) while semgrep 1.182.1 declares
# `mcp==1.29.0`; same --no-deps reason, and `semgrep scan` never starts an MCP server.
# The .txt also hand-pins the opentelemetry family to 1.45.1 / 0.66b1 (fixes GHSA-xcq7-p3pf-p88h)
# while semgrep declares `~=1.37.0`; same --no-deps reason. Regenerating reverts it to 1.37.0.
